  "note": "enemy_worksheet_instructor (R8 Folding School, magic academy; grader/labour; humanoid, human scale, stateful transform, motion grade_mark). Author design: a broad-shouldered instructor in a dark green academic gown with a high folded paper collar, spectacles and a square academic cap with a red tassel; a framed slate score board (chalk tally strokes, no text) in the left hand and a long red marking rod in the right (support reference: the hanging score slate of FAM-ARPG-19 Grading Wall, same region). Telegraph (field prop + pose): rod raised overhead, slate thrust forward. Signature (grade mark): body twisted, rod slashed down across the slate leaving a red stroke. Break (overflowed): slate split in two, sheets spilling out of the gown, body thrown back, rod dropped. Phase 1 Second Sheet: a second slate in the other hand, gown folded out of shape (misfolded). Phase 2 Final Mark: the torso has become a large slate and the rod is fixed on as the right arm. Front battler, 60 deg view.",
